WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.770
- Let me ask you a question,

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.290
have you ever felt powerful?

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:09.000
And if so, when was the last
time you felt truly powerful?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.120
Like your steps have extra weight to them.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.370
You have a steely-eyed focus.

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:16.710
The decisions that you make have clarity.

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.430
Obviously, it's impossible to
feel like this all the time.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.890
Life will throw a plethora of things

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:25.980
that will knock you off the
straight and narrow path.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:28.710
It will make you feel
powerless, or humiliated,

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.320
or anxious, embarrassed, nervous,

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.390
but hopefully we're able to come back

00:00:33.390 --> 00:00:37.350
to that feeling of empowerment,
that feeling of strength.

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:38.580
If it's been a while

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.970
since you've felt this
feeling of internal calm

00:00:41.970 --> 00:00:43.770
and power and presence,

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:44.670
then in this video,

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.250
I want to talk about
a strategy that I have

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.100
for converting the situations of life,

00:00:50.100 --> 00:00:54.480
as various as they may
be, into internal power.

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:56.130
And I know that sounds very woo-woo,

00:00:56.130 --> 00:00:58.110
but hopefully by the end of this video

00:00:58.110 --> 00:00:59.820
you understand where I'm coming from,

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.800
so you can use it to your advantage,

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.650
so that you can feel more
powerful, more often.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:06.870
You can truly be Giga Chad.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:10.650
I'm sure Giga Chad feels like this 24/7.

00:01:10.650 --> 00:01:14.940
He is the spirit of this
internal, benevolent power.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:16.470
And in order to feel this way,

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:19.795
we need to beware of snakes and ladders.

00:01:19.795 --> 00:01:22.545
(ominous music)

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.273
Now, in life,

00:01:35.273 --> 00:01:38.880
it's no surprise that there
are lots of places to go,

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:41.160
things to see, things to do,

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.530
but if we are not aware of what's a snake

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:44.790
and what's a ladder,

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:47.700
we'll do certain things
and go certain places

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:50.760
and partake in particular activities

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:54.120
that will either increase
our power or decrease it.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:57.270
The things that increase
our power are ladders

00:01:57.270 --> 00:02:00.210
and the things that decrease
our power are snakes.

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:03.120
So how do you identify
a snake and a ladder?

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.280
In order to properly identify

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.440
what's a snake and what's a ladder,

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.120
we need to figure out a little bit more

00:02:09.120 --> 00:02:10.590
about our psychology.

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.960
Now, our brain has many chemicals,

00:02:12.960 --> 00:02:16.170
chemicals that make us
feel very different ways.

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:20.190
The present oriented
chemicals include oxytocin,

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:23.730
endorphins, serotonin
and endocannabinoids.

00:02:23.730 --> 00:02:26.580
These brain chemicals
allow us to experience

00:02:26.580 --> 00:02:28.440
and savor the present moment,

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.990
what we have right here and right now.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:34.650
Dopamine is concerned with
what we don't yet have,

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.420
it makes us desire things

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.750
we can attain in the
immediate or distant future.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.610
It says, you should do this thing

00:02:41.610 --> 00:02:43.590
because you will get a reward.

00:02:43.590 --> 00:02:45.120
And it's important to realize

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:49.080
that these two types of brain
chemicals work in tandem.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:52.440
Usually things are some
degree of satisfying

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.480
and some degree of tempting,

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:58.020
but the weird thing is some
things are extremely tempting

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:00.960
and we feel a huge urge
to do these things,

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:04.290
but they're not that
satisfying, this is a snake.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:05.490
We live in a culture

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:09.720
that creates activities that
are lopsided in construction,

00:03:09.720 --> 00:03:12.510
front loaded with so much dopamine,

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:15.450
so much intrigue and
temptation to do them,

00:03:15.450 --> 00:03:18.930
but the satisfaction is usually all right

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:20.430
and it expires quickly.

00:03:20.430 --> 00:03:22.770
Snakes make you lose power.

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:26.220
They waste your time, energy and attention

00:03:26.220 --> 00:03:30.060
on things that give you a net
loss return on investment,

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:34.680
desire without satisfaction,
intrigue without resolution.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:38.790
The goal is to find activities
that have the right balance,

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:42.000
dopaminergic enough that
there's incentive to do them,

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:44.400
but satisfying and enjoyable enough

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:46.620
that they give you a
feeling of empowerment

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:48.750
and fulfillment in return.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.840
You have a deep sense of
feeling like it was worth it.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:55.440
It gave you something that you
can take forward into life,

00:03:55.440 --> 00:03:58.500
things that make you feel
better about yourself

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.080
and your life after having done them,

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:02.790
these are the ladders.

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:07.020
So before you dive into any
activity that you usually do,

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.560
ask yourself, is this a
snake or is this a ladder?

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.640
How can I tell?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.370
Well, how do I feel before I do it?

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:15.870
Am I very tempted to do it?

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.360
Is there this magnetic draw to do it?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.220
How do I feel while I do it?

00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:23.160
And how will I feel directly after I do it

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.560
and later in the day after having done it?

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.080
And maybe even a day after I do it

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.580
and a week after I do it?

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.590
If that is all cohesive,

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:34.590
if that feeling is good,
good, good, good, good,

00:04:34.590 --> 00:04:36.030
then you found yourself a ladder,

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:40.020
but if the answer is I
find myself drawn to do it

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.030
and it feels good when I do it,

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:46.680
but I feel like crap after
I do it, that's a snake.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:47.940
That is a serpent.

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:51.930
Okay, pop quiz, you're absolutely famished

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:55.770
after a hard days of working
on the field, that was English,

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:59.670
plowing, seeding, cutting the grass,

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.380
and you come into the door

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:05.370
and you smell the savory
smell of mama's nectar.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.450
I don't know what that is,

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:08.790
but let's just say it's a meat stew.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:12.420
You smell the garlicy, beefy goodness

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:14.280
as you walk in the front door,

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:16.620
and you find yourself extremely tempted

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:20.100
to go and gobble it down,
pour it down your throat,

00:05:20.100 --> 00:05:22.053
is that a snake or is that a ladder?

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:26.910
Well, it's probably a ladder
because you are working all day

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.570
and you need a high
protein, home cooked stew

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:34.410
that will nourish you and
help you recover your muscles

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:37.350
and you can take that
nutrition onwards in life,

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.240
it's just a win-win all around.

00:05:39.240 --> 00:05:41.130
There is both temptation

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:43.530
and a deep sense of resolution

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:46.170
and satisfaction and nourishment,

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.130
that is a ladder.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.480
Another quiz,

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.790
you're at the gym, busting out a set

00:05:50.790 --> 00:05:53.970
and some absolute dime piece

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.160
walks across your field of vision.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:06:00.150
You catch a glimpse and you
say, "Wow, that is crazy."

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:03.210
So let's just say, noticing
is a moral neutral,

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:04.860
but you're confronted with a choice.

00:06:04.860 --> 00:06:08.853
Continuing to stare, is
that a snake or a ladder?

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:11.490
Well, it's obviously a snake

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:16.200
because unless you're using
the beauty of this person

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:20.280
to motivate you to go form
a genuine relationship

00:06:20.280 --> 00:06:22.110
that is mutually beneficial,

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.330
that's the only situation
that it would be a ladder.

00:06:24.330 --> 00:06:27.990
But 99% of people in that
situation choose snake,

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:29.310
they look for the angles,

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.250
they try to bounce their vision
off of 16 different mirrors

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.860
to get a glimpse of the assets.

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:36.390
But why is that a snake?

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.280
Well, what is it doing for you?

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.960
It's making you want

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:43.590
and desire with absolutely no resolution.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:46.830
It's telling your brain that
there is value over there

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:49.410
that I don't have, and
I still don't have it,

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.520
and I still don't have it,

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:52.620
and I want it and I want it and I want it.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:55.230
Attraction is a tool,
just like anything else,

00:06:55.230 --> 00:06:57.480
but it's a tool to form connection,

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:59.700
and if you're not actually doing that,

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.250
then all you're doing is teasing yourself

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.717
and you're subconsciously
signaling to yourself that,

00:07:04.717 --> 00:07:08.550
"Wow, there is beauty in this
world and I don't have it."

00:07:08.550 --> 00:07:10.590
Do you think that is
an empowering feeling?

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:11.940
Let me leave you with this.

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:13.290
In Homer's Odyssey,

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.530
Odysseus didn't strap himself
to the mast of the ship

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.200
because he was afraid of feeling good,

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.690
he was aware of the siren's call.

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.900
He was aware that the temptation
would've been too strong

00:07:24.900 --> 00:07:27.420
because whatever satisfaction it promised

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:29.520
was just not going to be worth it.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:31.950
He was aware of the snakes,

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.220
the sirens, the dopaminergic temptation.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:38.580
If what the sirens offered
actually felt good,

00:07:38.580 --> 00:07:40.350
gave them something of value

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:42.540
that empowered them on their journey,

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:44.250
there would be no resistance.

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:45.750
But the wise man knows

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:48.960
that the siren offers
unfathomable pleasure,

00:07:48.960 --> 00:07:50.370
but doesn't deliver.

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.360
It's a sham.

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:53.220
Quite literally the definition

00:07:53.220 --> 00:07:56.040
of disorientation and disintegration,

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.930
a distraction from the mission.

00:07:57.930 --> 00:08:00.210
So if you look at the bigger picture,

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:02.640
accumulating this sense of power

00:08:02.640 --> 00:08:05.760
has nothing to do with avoiding pleasure.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.350
In fact, it's quite the opposite,

00:08:07.350 --> 00:08:09.420
it's about avoiding the cheap

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:12.210
and false proposition of pleasure.

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:14.400
It's not falling for the sirens,

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:17.400
who make things sound very
exciting and very tempting,

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.250
but don't actually give
you something in return.

00:08:20.250 --> 00:08:22.740
If you look at life with
a broader scope like this,

00:08:22.740 --> 00:08:25.980
then climbing as many
ladders as you can in life,

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:29.730
actually offers you more
satisfaction and enjoyment,

00:08:29.730 --> 00:08:33.840
both in the long run and often right now.

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:34.860
When you're doing something

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:37.200
that you know you're supposed to be doing

00:08:37.200 --> 00:08:38.880
and you submit to it,

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.390
you submit to your destiny
and to your calling,

00:08:42.390 --> 00:08:44.880
that feels good here and now.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:45.960
When you're finally writing

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.780
the paper that you've been
procrastinating forever

00:08:48.780 --> 00:08:50.820
and you're sitting there in a flow state,

00:08:50.820 --> 00:08:53.790
that feels existentially satisfying.

00:08:53.790 --> 00:08:56.580
You just want to melt into that moment

00:08:56.580 --> 00:09:00.120
and ask yourself, "Why aren't
I doing this all the time?"

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:04.980
That feeling of calm and duty is power.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.680
Power is this feeling of integration.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.570
The person that we want to be

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.793
is the person that we are being.

